    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d403-a1">

                <pb facs="0516" n="420" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg420"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Italian Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-09-24"><hi rendition="#italic">September 24,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chevalier</hi>: I herewith send you, for your
                    information, requesting that it may be returned to me, a copy of a decision
                    pronounced on the 27th of July last by the commission of arbitration at Naples,
                    whereby the emigration company known as the “Societa Nazionale Marittima” was
                    condemned to refund his passage money to Antonio Colaiacomo, who was sent back
                    from New York to the port where he had embarked owing to his advanced age and
                    his destitute condition.</p>
                <p>Accept, Mr. Agent, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Romano</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Royal Chargé d’Affaires.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
